<title>USA: McDonnell gets $106.3 mln contract increase.</title>
<headline>McDonnell gets $106.3 mln contract increase.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp has been awarded a $106.3 million increase to a contract for four F-15E attack jets, the Air Force said on Tuesday. The work is expected to be completed in January of 2000.</p>
</text>
